          <p class="lab-en">Vibration-Induced Emission (VIE) Fluorophores</p>
          <p class="lab-desc" id="vieLabDesc">
            在贺晓鹏教授课题组开展湿法有机合成训练，聚焦二氢二苯并吩嗪（Dihydrodibenzo[a,c]phenazine）类振动诱导发光体系，开展分子合成、柱层析分离提纯及温度/黏度响应双发射光谱表征。
          </p>
          <div class="vie-spec-chips" id="vieChips">
            <span>有机化学 96</span>
            <span>分析化学 96</span>
            <span>450 nm ↔ 610 nm 构象双发射</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vie-tuner" id="vieTuner">
          <div class="vie-tuner-head">
            <div class="vie-tuner-title">
              <span class="vie-cuvette" id="vieCuvette"></span>
              <span id="vieTunerTitle">UV DARKROOM · 双发射光谱实时调谐仪</span>
            </div>
            <div class="vie-readout">
              <span id="vieStateLabel">激发态平面化</span> <strong id="viePctVal">52%</strong> · <span>I₆₁₀ / I₄₅₀ = <strong id="vieRatioVal">1.08</strong></span>
