              <div class="vie-presets">
                <button type="button" class="vie-preset" data-vie="15">Bent · 蓝青</button>
                <button type="button" class="vie-preset active" data-vie="52">White · 白光平衡</button>
                <button type="button" class="vie-preset" data-vie="88">Planar · 红橙</button>
              </div>
              <div class="vie-state-caption" id="vieCaption">拖动滑块模拟温度/黏度变化下分子激发态由弯曲构象向平面化构象跃迁的连续比率荧光响应。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
